# Image component 规范

Shared image control: `imageFieldHtml` / `wireImageField` in `online-store/js/app.js`.
All `control: 'image'` fields use this design. Do not fork a second image picker.

## Layout and states

- Empty: dashed Select
- Filled: thin `1px solid #c9cccf` border, filename at bottom when idle
- Hover on filled: Change overlay only (no pencil / edit icon)
- Menu: Select from library / Remove only
- Select-from-library icon: solid filled landscape plate (cutout sun top-right + mountains), via `mediaSelectIcon()` — not outline frame; color inherits menu `#202223`
- Menu must stay fully visible (fixed to body; nudge inside panel edges)

## System copy

- Prototype system copy is English only
- Image menu labels: `Select from library`, `Remove`
- Keep `.os-img-menu` as `i18n-skip` so Chinese UI mode does not translate these

## Remove warning hover

- Idle Remove: text + trash icon `#8E0B21`
- Hover Remove: background `#FEE1E6`, text + icon `#8E0B21`
- Colors sampled from the online reference screenshot
